        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: LBJ\n- People: Rob Reiner, Joey Hartstone, Woody Harrelson, Richard Jenkins, Bill Pullman, Kim Allen, Michael Stahl-David, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Jeffrey Donovan, Doug McKeon, C. Thomas Howell, Michael Mosley\n- Awards and Lists: Academy Awards, Emmy Awards, Black List\n- Roles: President, actor, activist, playwright\n\nFacts:\n- Joey Hartstone wrote the script for the film LBJ, and that script appeared on the 2014 Black List.\n- Woody Harrelson was born on July 23, 1961.\n- Woody Harrelson is an American actor, activist, and playwright.\n- Woody Harrelson is a two-time Academy Award nominee.\n- Woody Harrelson has won one Emmy Award from seven nominations.\n- The American political drama film LBJ is directed by Rob Reiner.\n- Woody Harrelson stars in LBJ as the titular President.\n- The film LBJ also stars Richard Jenkins, Bill Pullman, Kim Allen, Michael Stahl-David, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Jeffrey Donovan, Doug McKeon, C. Thomas Howell, and Michael Mosley.",
